      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ab let suppose green ne pink ka token chura\nliya aur uss token ke saath req bheje toh\nserver ko lagega ki pink req bhej rha\naur aise na ho uske liye hum use karenge\nREFRESH and acess token iss se hoga ye\nki agar chori bhi ho jaye toh green wala\npink ka jyada use na kar payega hum ek limit\nlaga denge let suppose 15 min baad ye token expire ho \njaye toh ab green user pink ka nhi use kar payega 15 min baad\nlekin tb kya hoga pink ke saath yaha aata hai\nrefresh token jo use ek naya token de dega aur pink\nka kaam continue rhega green ka wo token jo usne pink ka\nchori kiya tha wo block ho jayega",
      "fontSize": 12.81342671534018,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ab let suppose green ne pink ka token chura\nliya aur uss token ke saath req bheje toh\nserver ko lagega ki pink req bhej rha\naur aise na ho uske liye hum use karenge\nREFRESH and acess token iss se hoga ye\nki agar chori bhi ho jaye toh green wala\npink ka jyada use na kar payega hum ek limit\nlaga denge let suppose 15 min baad ye token expire ho \njaye toh ab green user pink ka nhi use kar payega 15 min baad\nlekin tb kya hoga pink ke saath yaha aata hai\nrefresh token jo use ek naya token de dega aur pink\nka kaam continue rhega green ka wo token jo usne pink ka\nchori kiya tha wo block ho jayega",
